  "body": {
    "id": "thm:minimax-frontier",
    "kind": "theorem",
    "statement": "There exist constants \\(0<c<C<\\infty\\), depending only on \\((d,\\beta,L,G,H,\\underline f,\\overline f)\\), such that for all even \\(T\\ge32\\) and \\(B\\ge1\\), \\[cF_\\alpha(T,b)\\le R_T(B)\\le CF_\\alpha(T,b).\\] The upper inequality is attained by the implementable hard-cap policy \\(\\pi^\\star\\), and the lower inequality holds over all \\(\\Pi_{T,B}\\).",
